      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmpf ! Vous ne méritez rien de plus\nqu’une vulgaire tasse de café à 100 000 <U+E300>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comment ? Vous n’avez même pas 1 000 000 <U+E300>\nsur vous ?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nVous ne méritez rien de plus qu’une vulgaire\ntasse de café à 100 000 <U+E300>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avez-vous vraiment pesé le pour et le contre ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nInterrogez-vous : êtes-vous vraiment le genre de\npersonne qui mérite de boire un nectar pareil ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEst-ce vraiment raisonnable de dépenser\nune telle somme dans notre établissement ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nVos papilles gustatives sont-elles assez sensibles\npour saisir les propriétés uniques de ce café ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 339
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lorsque je parle des propriétés de ce café,\nje ne parle pas uniquement de son goût.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl faut aussi savoir reconnaître chaque ingrédient,\net la façon unique dont ils ont été préparés.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nVous considérez-vous vraiment à la hauteur\nde l’excellence que cette tasse exige ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 275
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je pense que oui.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000700065006E0073006500200071007500650020006F00750069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avez-vous le vocabulaire nécessaire pour décrire\nla saveur d’un café aussi rare ?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nN’allez pas me dire « ce café méritait son prix » !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCela vous classerait parmi les vulgaires ignares\npour qui la valeur des choses ne correspond<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nqu’au nombre inscrit sur l’étiquette !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 279
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je veux boire ce café !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007600650075007800200062006F006900720065002000630065002000630061006600E9002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’ai pas le niveau.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E20190061006900200070006100730020006C00650020006E00690076006500610075002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si vous dépensez un million pour boire ce café, et\nque vous vous contentez d’un avis médiocre,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nla honte vous poursuivra jusque dans la tombe !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMéritez-vous vraiment de boire une tasse de notre\nCafé Ultimate Super Premium : édition du siècle ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 253
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 5224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0075006900200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être pas...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 5240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750074002D00EA0074007200650020007000610073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il ne s’agit pas d’une question inconsidérée,\naussi vais-je vérifier une dernière fois.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMéritez-vous vraiment de boire une tasse de notre\nCafé Ultimate Super Premium : édition du siècle ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 5276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 195
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous allez me laisser boire ce café à la fin ?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075007300200061006C006C0065007A0020006D00650020006C00610069007300730065007200200062006F006900720065002000630065002000630061006600E9002000E00020006C0061002000660069006E0020003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Finalement, peut-être pas...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460069006E0061006C0065006D0065006E0074002C00200070006500750074002D00EA0074007200650020007000610073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelle réponse pleine de conviction...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nVous méritez indéniablement de goûter notre\nCafé Ultimate Super Premium : édition du siècle.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veuillez excuser mon insistance pendant\ncet interrogatoire.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 6104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006500750069006C006C0065007A002000650078006300750073006500720020006D006F006E00200069006E00730069007300740061006E00630065002000700065006E00640061006E0074000A00630065007400200069006E0074006500720072006F006700610074006F006900720065002E00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vous apporte votre commande sur-le-champ.\nDégustez-la à votre rythme.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 6232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voici votre tasse de Café Ultimate\nSuper Premium : édition du siècle.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 6388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F00690063006900200076006F007400720065002000740061007300730065002000640065002000430061006600E900200055006C00740069006D006100740065000A005300750070006500720020005000720065006D00690075006D0020003A002000E90064006900740069006F006E00200064007500200073006900E80063006C0065002E00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, hop ! Je vais boire ça d’une traite !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 6536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C00200068006F0070002000210020004A00650020007600610069007300200062006F006900720065002000E700610020006420190075006E00650020007400720061006900740065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je me prépare psychologiquement et j’y vais.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 6628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006D006500200070007200E90070006100720065002000700073007900630068006F006C006F00670069007100750065006D0065006E00740020006500740020006A2019007900200076006100690073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors ? Qu’avez-vous pensé de notre Café Ultimate\nSuper Premium : édition du siècle ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 6720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’ai jamais ressenti une telle plénitude.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E2019006100690020006A0061006D006100690073002000720065007300730065006E0074006900200075006E0065002000740065006C006C006500200070006C00E9006E00690074007500640065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sa saveur était absolument incomparable.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300610020007300610076006500750072002000E900740061006900740020006100620073006F006C0075006D0065006E007400200069006E0063006F006D00700061007200610062006C0065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous devriez parler d’édition du millénaire !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 7076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006400650076007200690065007A0020007000610072006C0065007200200064201900E90064006900740069006F006E0020006400750020006D0069006C006C00E9006E0061006900720065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bah, ça avait un goût de café...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 7168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200610068002C002000E7006100200061007600610069007400200075006E00200067006F00FB0074002000640065002000630061006600E9002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comprendre cette vérité fait partie de l’expérience\ninoubliable qui accompagne un café à ce prix-là.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 7236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voilà une appréciation fort généreuse à la hauteur\nd’un café à ce prix-là !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Très bien... Cela fera donc 1 000 000 <U+E300>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 7608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007200E800730020006200690065006E002E002E002E002000430065006C00610020006600650072006100200064006F006E006300200031002000300030003000200030003000300020E300002E00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ces grains d’une extrême richesse doivent être\nravis d’avoir satisfait une personne aussi riche<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nd’esprit que vous !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
